==Event Information==
Celebrating {{Color|#FF0000|'''1 Year of The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Join in the festivities from {{Color|#FF00CC|'''9/17 until 10/17 (～11:00am)!!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special English-version-Only Stages!'''}}<br>
Visit the Event Stages/Stories of Legend during this event to challenge the special stage {{Color|#FF00CC|'''"Minced Meet-Up"'''}}!<br>
Clear the stages to collect the limited edition character {{Color|#FF00CC|'''"'''}}[[Catburger (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Catburger'''}}]]{{Color|#FF00CC|'''"'''}}!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 1 Year Celebration Stages!'''}}<br>
Celebrate 1 year of feline fun with the {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Happy Birthday" Stages!'''}}<br>
Clear the stages with a high score to collect cool rewards!<br>
・{{Color|#FF00CC|'''"Happy Birthday No. 1"'''}}: 9/17 (11:00am) to 10/17 (10:59)<br>
・{{Color|#FF00CC|'''"Happy Birthday No. 2"'''}}: 9/22 (11:00am) to 10/17 (10:59)<br>
・{{Color|#FF00CC|'''"Happy Birthday No. 3"'''}}: 9/28 (11:00am) to 10/17 (10:59)

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Tons of Limited-Edition Stages!!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Daily Special Stages'''}}<br>
Event Period: 9/17 (11:00am) to 9/23 (10:59)<br>
All five daily stages will be available to play every day!<br>
{{Color|#008000|'''・XP Special Stages'''}}<br>
Event Period: 9/23 (11:00am) to 9/29 (10:59)<br>
Blitz XP Stages available all day every day!<br>
XP Megablitz Stages available each day from 6:00pm to 7:00pm!<br>
{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''・Awakened Special Stages'''}}<br>
Event Period: 9/29 (11:00am) to 10/6 (10:59)<br>
{{Color|#82318E|'''・Crazed Cat Special Stages'''}}<br>
Event Period: 10/6 (11:00am) to 10/12 (10:59)<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Cylcone Special Stages'''}}<br>
Event Period: 10/12 (11:00am) to 10/17 (10:59)

Check the daily event information for more details about each day's events!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 20% Off All Rare Capsules'''}}<br>
Event Period: 9/17 (11:00～) until 10/3 (～11:00)<br>
All regular Cat Food costs for Capsules SLASHED by 20%!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● A Bonus Cat Food Gift Each Day!!'''}}<br>
Get a free {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Rare Ticket'''}} upon your first login during this campaign!<br>
Get {{Color|#FF00CC|'''20 Cat Food EACH DAY'''}} when you log in to the app!

Thanks a bunch!!!

